          "name": "Request a Free Quote",
          "text": "Contact STS at 844-699-2913 or use the online quote form. Provide equipment types, approximate quantities, pickup timing, and any documentation requirements.",
          "url": "https://www.stselectronicrecyclinginc.com/quote"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "Schedule Pickup",
          "text": "Confirm a pickup window for the Bakersfield project. Scheduling can account for equipment volume, site access, business operations, and the needs of healthcare, education, government, agricultural, or commercial organizations."
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 3,
          "name": "Arrange Secure Transport",
          "text": "STS coordinates the movement of equipment from Bakersfield to a processing operation with documented chain of custody. Teams can review loading access, consolidation requirements, and data-bearing asset controls before collection."
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 4,
          "name": "Track Assets and Handle Data",
          "text": "Equipment is received and processed according to the project scope. Serial-level tracking, documented data handling, certificates, and NIST 800-88 reference procedures may be included when required."
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 5,
          "name": "Process Recovered Materials",
          "text": "Electronics are sorted for appropriate downstream processing and material recovery. Functional equipment may be reviewed for remarketing, while recovered materials are directed through documented channels."
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "position": 6,
          "name": "Receive Project Documentation",
          "text": "STS provides available project records, including equipment inventories, certificates of destruction, method details, weights, and downstream tracking documentation when included in the agreed scope.",
