          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What certifications and standards do you support?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS uses documented processes that support NIST SP 800-88 media sanitization guidance, HIPAA-oriented data handling, and applicable environmental reporting. Project documentation can be structured around your organization’s policies, equipment inventory, and audit needs."
