            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS Electronic Recycling tracks collected Bakersfield assets through a documented process, with data-bearing media managed according to the agreed scope. Equipment then moves through transparent, sustainable processing and material recovery channels, supported by records that help organizations reconcile retired technology with internal asset controls."
          }
        }
